00:07:45.121 --> 00:07:47.020
Core Concepts, Beginner to Deep.

112
00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:51.342
Intuition: a counter with a limited batch of sweets.

113
00:07:51.622 --> 00:07:54.587
A sweet shop has 5,000 boxes of a special.

114
00:07:54.867 --> 00:07:57.982
If everyone crowds one counter, the queue is the counter.

115
00:07:58.262 --> 00:08:05.771
Open 16 counters with a share of boxes each and the crowd moves faster, but sold out means asking every counter.

116
00:08:06.051 --> 00:08:12.878
Put a guard at the door with a clicker who stops letting people in after 5,000, and the counters never see the crowd.

117
00:08:13.158 --> 00:08:16.337
Give each buyer a few minutes to pay before the box goes back.

118
00:08:16.617 --> 00:08:22.121
And remember that the shop's ledger may say 5,000 while a few boxes were dropped in the back.

119
00:08:23.471 --> 00:08:24.431
