206
00:13:35.682 --> 00:13:45.175
Expiry: a sweeper returns expired HELD quantities to stock (in the same transaction as the status change), plus lazy checks at confirmation.

207
00:13:45.455 --> 00:13:51.770
Confirmation: payment captured, then reservation CONFIRMED (idempotently, Ch 45).

208
00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:54.994
Late capture: payment arrives after expiry.

209
00:13:55.274 --> 00:13:58.303
If stock is still available, re-reserve and confirm.

210
00:13:58.583 --> 00:14:02.786
Otherwise auto-refund and tell the customer; never silently oversell.

