337
00:20:15.126 --> 00:20:22.934
The cart shows indicative prices; checkout recomputes with the current price list and promotions and shows changes before payment.

338
00:20:23.214 --> 00:20:36.931
Coupon budgets (first 10,000 orders get 100 rupeesoff) are another hot counter: use the same techniques (atomic decrement, buckets, gates) and reserve the budget with the order, releasing it on expiry.

339
00:20:37.211 --> 00:20:46.833
Snapshot the final price, tax and promo per line into the order (immutable) for invoices (Ch 36) and refunds (Ch 45).

