346
00:21:16.423 --> 00:21:23.313
On failure, abandonment or expiry, then release reservations; late capture, then re-reserve or refund.

347
00:21:24.663 --> 00:21:32.173
Everything keyed by checkout id; every step idempotent; stuck sagas surface as NEEDSATTENTION (Ch 13).

348
00:21:33.523 --> 00:21:34.653
