00:41:23.325 --> 00:41:25.608
Failure, and Symptom, and Mitigation.

556
00:41:25.888 --> 00:41:26.805
Hot row.

557
00:41:27.085 --> 00:41:27.896
Symptom:

558
00:41:28.176 --> 00:41:31.120
