559
00:41:31.400 --> 00:41:32.403
Mitigation:

560
00:41:32.683 --> 00:41:35.456
Buckets, gate, bulkheads per SKU class.

561
00:41:35.736 --> 00:41:37.293
Locks across round trips.

562
00:41:37.573 --> 00:41:38.384
Symptom:

563
00:41:38.664 --> 00:41:40.200
Longer queues (L1).

564
00:41:40.480 --> 00:41:41.483
Mitigation:

565
00:41:41.763 --> 00:41:44.259
Conditional UPDATE, tiny transactions.

566
00:41:44.539 --> 00:41:46.032
Probing empty buckets.

567
00:41:46.312 --> 00:41:47.123
Symptom:

568
00:41:47.403 --> 00:41:49.771
DB flooded after sell-out (L1).

569
00:41:50.051 --> 00:41:51.053
Mitigation:

570
00:41:51.333 --> 00:41:52.507
Sold-out flag.

571
00:41:52.787 --> 00:41:54.301
