576
00:42:02.592 --> 00:42:03.595
Long holds.

577
00:42:03.875 --> 00:42:04.685
Symptom:

578
00:42:04.965 --> 00:42:06.565
Stranded stock (L2).

579
00:42:06.845 --> 00:42:07.848
Mitigation:

580
00:42:08.128 --> 00:42:10.624
Short TTL + extension on intent.

581
00:42:10.904 --> 00:42:12.035
Late captures.

582
00:42:12.315 --> 00:42:13.125
Symptom:

583
00:42:13.405 --> 00:42:15.197
Charged, no item (L2).

584
