Phantom stock.

587
00:42:21.270 --> 00:42:22.081
Symptom:

588
00:42:22.361 --> 00:42:23.961
Missing items (L3).

589
00:42:24.241 --> 00:42:25.243
Mitigation:

590
00:42:25.523 --> 00:42:27.422
