591
00:42:27.702 --> 00:42:28.769
Flash crowd.

592
00:42:29.049 --> 00:42:29.859
Symptom:

593
00:42:30.139 --> 00:42:33.190
Timeouts, retry storms, unfairness (L4).

594
00:42:33.470 --> 00:42:34.473
Mitigation:

595
00:42:34.753 --> 00:42:36.971
Waiting room, idempotent retries.

596
00:42:38.321 --> 00:42:39.409
Observability.

597
00:42:39.689 --> 00:42:44.468
Reservation latency and lock waits per SKU; top contended rows.

598
00:42:44.748 --> 00:42:50.316
Held versus confirmed versus expired reservations; stranded stock; late captures.

599
00:42:50.596 --> 00:42:54.308
Pick shortfalls per SKU or store; buffer effectiveness.

600
00:42:54.588 --> 00:42:58.556
Waiting-room queue length, admission rate, time to answer, abandonment.

601
00:42:59.906 --> 00:43:00.845
Security.

602
00:43:01.125 --> 00:43:05.583
Bot protection and per-customer limits on flash deals (Ch 39).

603
00:43:05.863 --> 00:43:09.021
Signed waiting-room tokens bound to customer and sale.

604
00:43:09.301 --> 00:43:12.373
Server-side price and promo computation only.

605
00:43:13.723 --> 00:43:14.619
Performance.

606
00:43:14.899 --> 00:43:18.611
Reservation transaction: two statements, no remote calls.

607
00:43:18.891 --> 00:43:22.560
Separate connection pools (bulkheads) for flash-sale SKUs.

608
00:43:22.840 --> 00:43:27.640
Pre-warm and pre-scale before announced sales; load test with the real crowd shape.

609
00:43:28.990 --> 00:43:29.715
Cost.

610
00:43:29.995 --> 00:43:37.398
Flash-sale infrastructure (gate, waiting room) is used a few hours a month: edge-hosted and serverless options fit.

611
00:43:37.678 --> 00:43:44.441
Buffers trade hidden stock for fewer refunds and support calls; measure both in rupees (Ch 35).

612
00:43:45.791 --> 00:43:46.729
